{"id":"49440e374bb38c72","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-random-acceptance-probability.md","title":"随机机的概率与期望时间","display":"df-random-acceptance-probability — 随机机的概率与期望时间","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-random-acceptance-probability","aliases":["73-df-random-acceptance-probability"],"display":"df-random-acceptance-probability — 随机机的概率与期望时间","depends_on":["[[73-df-random-halting-prefixes]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.4.3 and §11.4.6, print pp. 504–506, 509–510; PDF pp. 526–528, 531–532; local probability construction","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-random-acceptance-probability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-random-acceptance-probability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-random-acceptance-probability — 随机机的概率与期望时间"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"268198a54d09f8b1\" href=\"?note=268198a54d09f8b1\" title=\"73-df-random-halting-prefixes\">73-df-random-halting-prefixes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.4.3 and §11.4.6, print pp. 504–506, 509–510; PDF pp. 526–528, 531–532; local probability construction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}\">\\(\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}\">\\(\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"268198a54d09f8b1\" href=\"?note=268198a54d09f8b1\" title=\"73-df-random-halting-prefixes\">73-df-random-halting-prefixes</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(t,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；上确界在扩展非负实数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,+\\infty]\">\\([0,+\\infty]\\)</span> 中取，有限空和为零。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{M,w},R_{M,w},H_{M,w}\">\\(A_{M,w},R_{M,w},H_{M,w}\\)</span> 及其上确界均显式依赖固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\">\\(M,w\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_{M,w}(t)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{r\\in\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}\\\\|r|\\le t}}2^{-|r|},\\qquad\nR_{M,w}(t)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{r\\in\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}\\\\|r|\\le t}}2^{-|r|},\\qquad\nH_{M,w}(t)\\coloneqq A_{M,w}(t)+R_{M,w}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_{M,w}(t)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{r\\in\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}\\\\|r|\\le t}}2^{-|r|},\\qquad\nR_{M,w}(t)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{r\\in\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}\\\\|r|\\le t}}2^{-|r|},\\qquad\nH_{M,w}(t)\\coloneqq A_{M,w}(t)+R_{M,w}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr_M^a(w)\\coloneqq\\sup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}A_{M,w}(t),\\quad\n\\Pr_M^r(w)\\coloneqq\\sup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}R_{M,w}(t),\\quad\n\\mathbb E_M(w)\\coloneqq\\sup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\sum_{t=0}^{m}(1-H_{M,w}(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr_M^a(w)\\coloneqq\\sup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}A_{M,w}(t),\\quad\n\\Pr_M^r(w)\\coloneqq\\sup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}R_{M,w}(t),\\quad\n\\mathbb E_M(w)\\coloneqq\\sup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\sum_{t=0}^{m}(1-H_{M,w}(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>t 时刻前只涉及有限多个比特串，故有限和无需引入外部测度原子。停机前缀互不延长，2 的负长度权重恰是公平独立比特前缀的概率。期望用尾和定义：无穷运行的概率质量或重尾运行可使其为 +∞。没有把某条零概率的无穷随机带当成正概率事件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-random-halting-prefixes","status":"resolved","id":"268198a54d09f8b1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-random-halting-prefixes]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-random-halting-prefixes","status":"resolved","id":"268198a54d09f8b1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$、$\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)$ 与 $w\\in\\Sigma^*$；$\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}$、$\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}$ 采用 [[73-df-random-halting-prefixes]]。$t,m\\in\\mathbb N$；上确界在扩展非负实数 $[0,+\\infty]$ 中取，有限空和为零。$A_{M,w},R_{M,w},H_{M,w}$ 及其上确界均显式依赖固定 $M,w$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RandTM}_\\Sigma(M)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}","display":false},{"tex":"t,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[0,+\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"A_{M,w},R_{M,w},H_{M,w}","display":false},{"tex":"M,w","display":false},{"tex":"A_{M,w}(t)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{r\\in\\operatorname{AP}_{M,w}\\\\|r|\\le t}}2^{-|r|},\\qquad\nR_{M,w}(t)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\substack{r\\in\\operatorname{RP}_{M,w}\\\\|r|\\le t}}2^{-|r|},\\qquad\nH_{M,w}(t)\\coloneqq A_{M,w}(t)+R_{M,w}(t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pr_M^a(w)\\coloneqq\\sup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}A_{M,w}(t),\\quad\n\\Pr_M^r(w)\\coloneqq\\sup_{t\\in\\mathbb N}R_{M,w}(t),\\quad\n\\mathbb E_M(w)\\coloneqq\\sup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\sum_{t=0}^{m}(1-H_{M,w}(t)).","display":true}],"bytes":1967,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-random-acceptance-probability]]"},{"id":"1c185b4536ca59db","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2768770bc528cab8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b2353339955c9c49","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-random-acceptance-probability|随机机的概率与期望时间]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"29f67a62b22dd6a8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["268198a54d09f8b1"]}